apk update
apk add openssh
ssh-keygen -A

vim /etc/ssh/sshd_config
PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
ChallengeResponseAuthentication yes
PermitTTY yes

passwd user
/usr/sbin/sshd

ssh user@localhost

since iOS app do not have network in the background
so iSH app need run in the front, or use Stage Manager for multiple app at the front

you can use WebSSH app to connect it, and run chatbot 

